+
+## Request
+
+Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901). Export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`; it
+returns the referenced value and throws if the pointer is not a valid JSON Pointer or does not resolve
+to a value in the document. Later features build on it.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- "" refers to the whole document; otherwise the pointer must start with "/".
+- Tokens unescape `~1` -> `/` then `~0` -> `~`; any other `~` use is invalid.
+- Objects: own properties only (no prototype lookups). Arrays: index must be "0" or digits without
+  leading zeros; "-" and out-of-range do not resolve. Primitives/null cannot be traversed.
